### Criar nova busca de produto
POST http://localhost:3001/api/search-product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "PS5",
  "maxResults": 50
}

### Criar busca com categoria
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search-product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Xbox Series X",
  "maxResults": 30,
  "category": "Games e Consoles"
}

### Criar busca com faixa de preço
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search-product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Nintendo Switch",
  "maxResults": 25,
  "priceRange": {
    "min": 1000,
    "max": 3000
  }
}

### Criar busca com todos os parâmetros
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search-product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Smartphone Samsung",
  "maxResults": 100,
  "category": "Eletrônicos",
  "priceRange": {
    "min": 500,
    "max": 5000
  }
}

### Teste de validação - Nome vazio
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search-product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "",
  "maxResults": 50
}

### Teste de validação - MaxResults inválido
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search-product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "PS5",
  "maxResults": 150
}

### Teste de validação - Faixa de preço inválida
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search-product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "PS5",
  "priceRange": {
    "min": 5000,
    "max": 1000
  }
}

### Consultar status da busca (substitua pelo ID real)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/search-product/03140561-dfde-4997-81b6-9f5ccc2ad85b

### Consultar busca específica (substitua pelo ID real)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/search-product/03140561-dfde-4997-81b6-9f5ccc2ad85b
